msgid "For additional network features, see:"
msgstr "Weitere Netzwerkfunktionen finden Sie unter:"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:127
msgid ""
":ref:`system-administration-network-vlan` for network isolation and "
"security."
msgstr ""
":ref:`system-administration-network-vlan` für Netzwerkisolation und "
"Sicherheit."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:128
msgid ":ref:`system-administration-network-bonding` for redundancy and failover."
msgstr ":ref:`system-administration-network-bonding` für Redundanz und Failover."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:129
msgid ":ref:`system-administration-network-bridge` for virtualization networking."
msgstr ":ref:`system-administration-network-bridge` für Virtualisierungs-Netzwerk."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:134
msgid "Define name servers"
msgstr "DNS-Server definieren"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:136
msgid "There are two types of DNS servers:"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Arten von DNS-Servern:"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:138
msgid "External DNS Server"
msgstr "Externer DNS-Server"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:139
msgid ""
"Use external DNS servers to look up domain names outside your network, "
"such as ``example.com``. Your internet provider usually supplies these "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie externe DNS-Server, um Domänennamen außerhalb Ihres "
"Netzwerks nachzuschlagen, z.B. ``example.com``. Ihr Internetanbieter "
"stellt diese Server normalerweise bereit."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:142
msgid "Domain DNS Server"
msgstr "Domain-DNS-Server"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:143
msgid ""
"A domain DNS server is the local DNS server for your Nubus for UCS "
"domain. It looks up domain names and IP addresses for systems in your "
"domain. When a query doesn't match a domain name in your LDAP directory, "
"the domain DNS server forwards it to an external DNS server. All domain "
"DNS servers in your Nubus for UCS domain return the same information "
"because they query the same LDAP directory."
msgstr ""
"Ein Domain-DNS-Server ist der lokale DNS-Server für Ihre Nubus für UCS "
"Domäne. Er schlägt Domänennamen und IP-Adressen für Systeme in Ihrer "
"Domain nach. Wenn eine Abfrage keinem Domänennamen in Ihrem LDAP-"
"Verzeichnis entspricht, leitet der Domain-DNS-Server sie an einen "
"externen DNS-Server weiter. Alle Domain-DNS-Server in Ihrer Nubus für UCS"
" Domäne geben die gleichen Informationen zurück, da sie das gleiche LDAP-"
"Verzeichnis abfragen."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:150
msgid ""
"Nubus for UCS has three directory node types: :term:`Primary Directory "
"Node`, :term:`Backup Directory Node`, and :term:`Replica Directory Node`."
" Each runs a local DNS server for your domain."
msgstr ""
"Nubus für UCS hat drei Typen von :spelling:word:`Directory-Nodes`: "
":term:`Primary Directory Node`, :term:`Backup Directory Node` und "
":term:`Replica Directory Node`. Jeder führt einen lokalen DNS-Server für "
"Ihre Domain aus."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:153
msgid ""
"To configure name resolution, enter the IP address of your domain's DNS "
"server in the *Domain DNS Server* field. For the primary domain DNS "
"server, use the address of your Primary Directory Node."
msgstr ""
"Geben Sie zum Konfigurieren der Namensauflösung die IP-Adresse des DNS-"
"Servers Ihrer Domain im Feld *Domain-DNS-Server* ein. Verwenden Sie für "
"den primären Domain-DNS-Server die Adresse Ihres Primary Directory Node."

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:159
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can set name servers through :term:`UCR variables <UCR"
" variable>`:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativ können Sie DNS-Server über :term:`UCR-Variablen <UCR "
"variable>` festlegen:"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:161
msgid ":envvar:`nameserver1` to :envvar:`nameserver3`"
msgstr ":envvar:`nameserver1` bis :envvar:`nameserver3`"

#: ../../system-administration/network/basic.rst:162
msgid ":envvar:`dns/forwarder1` to :envvar:`dns/forwarder3`"
msgstr ":envvar:`dns/forwarder1` bis :envvar:`dns/forwarder3`"

